| !Boot for ArchieEmu's HostFS: runs at power-on when the CMOS says
| *Configure FileSystem HostFS and *Configure Boot.
| On RISC OS 3.5-3.7 it loads the monitor definition for the emulator, so
| that the Display Manager offers resolutions and colours.
| RISC OS 3.1 has no ScreenModes module and skips it.
RMEnsure ScreenModes 0.00 Set ArchieEmu$NoMDF 1
If "<ArchieEmu$NoMDF>"="" Then LoadModeFile <Obey$Dir>.Monitors.ArchieEmu
Unset ArchieEmu$NoMDF
